--- SCE parameters --------
Space charge map (in pdUtils/data). The alternative map is SCE_Alternate_v4_EField.root
 < pdUtils.SCE.MapFile = SCE_DataDriven_180kV_v4.root >

--- Calorimetry --------
Nominal electric field (kV/cm) and ModBox recombination parameters used by
Calorimetry. Note: RecombinationDataCorrection uses its own values
(E = 0.553 kV/cm); it is not known whether the difference is intended.
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.Efield  = 0.4867 >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.ModBoxA = 0.930  >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.ModBoxB = 0.212  >

Drift velocity (cm/us) and APA x position (cm), for the lifetime correction
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.Vdrift = 0.156461 >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.APAx   = 368.351  >

Calibration constants from ADC area to electrons, per plane
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.CalAreaConstant.Plane0 = 1.04e-3   >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.CalAreaConstant.Plane1 = 1.04e-3   >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.CalAreaConstant.Plane2 = 1.0156e-3 >

PID tables (in pdUtils/data): dE/dx vs residual range templates, and kinetic energy vs range
 < pdUtils.PID.dEdxTemplatesFile = dEdxrestemplates.root >
 < pdUtils.PID.KEvsRangeFile     = ke_vs_range.root      >

dQ/dx calibration files (in pdUtils/data)
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.NormFile  = mc_prod4_dQdx_norm.txt  >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.XCalFile  = mc_prod4_dQdx_XCal.txt  >
 < pdUtils.Calorimetry.YZCalFile = mc_prod4_dQdx_YZCal.txt >

Electron lifetime (us) for MC and for each data run
